⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Festival
node ARN · ARN · ⟦The Festival:ARN:f57ef8⟧

WHO   — The Festival — the annual tournament
WHAT  — The clock of the novel: the great annual contest that draws every power to Estark, and the stage the stranger walks onto.
WHERE — ARN · Arena  Framework inputs: Arena (Forstchen, 1994)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the Western's showdown needs its appointed day — Festival is when the city's powers are all in one place to be turned on each other.
HOW   — By an annual tournament of the Houses, its crowds, its circles, and its high stakes.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am the day the city gathers to watch its mages duel — and the day a one-eyed stranger chose to walk in and end the whole tradition.

